## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to send up to 5 BGP routes to IBGP peer group "VPN_CORE" in a multi-instance VPNv4 environment?
---
## Proposed answer:
set routing-instances instance-name routing-options bgp group VPN_CORE type internal
set routing-instances instance-name routing-options bgp group VPN_CORE export export-policy
set routing-instances instance-name routing-options policies export export-policy rule 1 action accept
