## User question:
"How to configure a Nokia router to exchange labeled IPv4 routes with peer 192.168.5.9 while enabling tunnel reachability checks?"
---
## Proposed answer:
tunnel reachability-check enable
mpls ldp traffic-eng tunnels
ipv4 mpls traffic-eng tunnels
router bgp 65000
neighbor 192.168.5.9 remote-as 65000
neighbor 192.168.5.9 route-map LABELLED_ROUTES out
route-map LABELLED_ROUTES permit 10
route-map LABELLED_ROUTES match ip address labeled_ipv4
---
