{'Parameters': 'compatible', 'Info': 'Indicates the compatibility mode. If this keyword is specified, the TTL in packets sent by BFD is set to 255.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'per-link', 'Info': 'Establishes a BFD session to monitor the link between member interfaces.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'one-arm-echo', 'Info': 'Indicates a one-arm BFD echo session.\n-'}
