---
## Proposed answer:
router bgp 65001
address-family ipv6 unicast
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 remote-as 65001
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 send-community both
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 next-hop-self
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 advertise-community
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 as-override
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 maximum-prefix 1000
neighbor 2001:DB8:2::2 route-map PREPEND_IN out
route-map PREPEND_IN permit 10
set as-path prepend 65001 65001
exit-address-family
---
