## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to filter advertised BGP-IPv6 unicast routes to peer 192.168.50.25 using basic ACL6 named "IPV6_FILTER"?
---
## Proposed answer:
ip access-list standard IPV6_FILTER
permit ipv6 any
route-filter ::/0 prefix-length-range ::/0 ::/0 reject subprefix-length
peer 192.168.50.25 route-map IPV6_FILTER out
---
## Router configuration manual:
