How to configure a Nokia router to allow a Route Reflector to modify BGP route attributes via an export policy in IPv6 unicast address family?
---
## Proposed answer:
route-policy export-policy permit node 10
set ipv6 next-hop unchanged
set metric 50
router bgp <AS_NUMBER>
address-family ipv6 unicast
route-reflector client
redistribute route-policy export-policy
exit-address-family
