How to configure a BGP VPN peer group named "remote_peers" on a Nokia router to only accept incoming connections without initiating any outbound connection requests?
---
## Proposed answer:
peer-group remote_peers
remote-as <AS_NUMBER>
import route-filter * from peer
export route-filter * to peer suppress-policy no-export
no peer-group member remote_peers
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
