## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to allow labeled routes recursing to IP addresses for optimal path selection in BGP IPv6 SR-Policy address family?
---
## Proposed answer:
policy-options { routing-policy { import MY_POLICY { term ALLOW_LABELED_ROUTES { from { route-filter *::/* exact; } then { accept; } } } } }
policy-options { routing-policy { export MY_POLICY { term ALLOW_LABELED_ROUTES { then { route-target both ipv6-sr-policy:EXPORT; } } } }
router bgp { address-family ipv6-sr-policy { label-switched-path { lsp-name { import-policy ALLOW_LABELED_ROUTES; export-policy ALLOW_LABELED_ROUTES; } } } }
